    {
      "id": "orm_null_strategy",
      "fact": "本地mybatis-plus-core 3.5.10.1 GlobalConfig.DbConfig构造器经javap检查，insertStrategy和updateStrategy默认均为NOT_NULL；目标四个PO字段没有字段级覆盖，office application.yml未配置策略覆盖。",
      "dependency": {"absolute_path": "/Users/eric/.m2/repository/com/baomidou/mybatis-plus-core/3.5.10.1/mybatis-plus-core-3.5.10.1.jar", "sha256": "7a3ea960e4aaa1408486ae04d3a1136d4d519cf273d9fc3e36f0d7ddf02fe72d", "method": "javap -c -p com.baomidou.mybatisplus.core.config.GlobalConfig$DbConfig"},
      "locations": [{"source_id": "calendar_po", "lines": [65, 96]}, {"source_id": "document_po", "lines": [80, 112]}, {"source_id": "office_config", "lines": [65, 87]}],
      "inference": "按该默认策略生成的BaseMapper插入省略null属性对应列，由数据库DEFAULT补0；更新省略null属性对应列，保留原值。不能推为显式写SQL NULL，也不能推为更新会把历史NULL补0。",
      "condition": "未加载外部配置或自定义Bean改变字段策略；本轮未抓取运行SQL。数据库显式NULL与省略列是不同实验。"
    },
    {
